<title>USA: Youth Services Q3 net shr loss $2.19.</title>
<headline>Youth Services Q3 net shr loss $2.19.</headline>
<dateline>OWINGS MILLS, Md. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss	  $2.19	 profit   $0.07</p>
<p> Net loss	  21,359	profit   635</p>
<p> Revs		27,250		   25,309</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  9,769		    9,350</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Included in the results is the prevoulsy announced one-time restructuring charge of $27.0 million incurred in connection with the company's decision to dispose of its behavioral health business. Without the charge, the company would have incurred a loss of $454,000, or $0.05 per share for the quarter.</p>
